    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Chibi Friend</strong> is an adorable companion that lives on your desktop. This tiny buddy will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around, eat, sleep, and clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change expressions and chat with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a lively charm to your desktop experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BY YOUR SIDE THROUGH ALL YOUR TASKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cute desktop companion never leaves you alone, even during your busiest work sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729600/extras/60115d89fe71d4d03f5ef347e8a760ee.poster.avif?t=1748176232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729600/extras/60115d89fe71d4d03f5ef347e8a760ee.webm?t=1748176232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729600/extras/60115d89fe71d4d03f5ef347e8a760ee.mp4?t=1748176232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR SCREEN IS NOW THEIR HOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you're browsing social media or watching shows and movies, they\u2019ll clean up the desktop, eat, and patiently wait for you<br></p>",
